# Migration 002: Path Reference Updates

ID: 002-path-references
Status: APPLIED
AppliedAt: 2026-08-29T08:15:00Z

Description:
  Update all internal path references after project separation.
  Ensures .sdd/ files, chains, commands, and workflows reference
  the correct project instance paths.

Before:
  .sdd/project/decisions/
  .sdd/project/tasks/
  .sdd/project/docs/
  .sdd/project/stack/
  @project/decisions/INDEX.sdd
  @project/tasks/INDEX.sdd

After:
  .sdd/projects/vkard.az/decisions/
  .sdd/projects/vkard.az/tasks/
  .sdd/projects/vkard.az/docs/
  .sdd/projects/vkard.az/stack/
  @projects/vkard.az/decisions/INDEX.sdd
  @projects/vkard.az/tasks/INDEX.sdd

Actions:
  1. Scan all .sdd/*.sdd and .sdd/**/*.sdd for .sdd/project/<subdir>/ references
  2. Replace with .sdd/projects/vkard.az/<subdir>/
  3. Replace @project/ references with @projects/vkard.az/
  4. Update chain token paths (../../project/tokens/ -> ../../projects/vkard.az/tokens/)
  5. Update command references (sdd-decisions, sdd-status)
  6. Update workflow references

Validation:
  - No .sdd/project/(decisions|tasks|docs|stack|...)/ references remain
  - All @project/ references updated to @projects/vkard.az/
  - Chain tokens resolve correctly

Rollback: NOT SUPPORTED (use git revert if needed)

State: +
